            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Activity is the sum of rental and return events from successfully matched station endpoints. Each trip contributes one rental event at its origin and one return event at its destination; for a same-station trip, both events are counted at that station. The Top 10 are ranked by total activity over the full analysis period. High activity does not necessarily imply high directional imbalance.'"
